  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Blinding Light",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Blood of Angels pg. 24",
    "definition_raw": "Source Blood of Angels pg. 24\nYou use your impenetrable luminescence to disorient harbingers of darkness.\n\nPrerequisites: Inner Light, aasimar, daylight spell-like ability.\n\nBenefit: Whenever an enemy unsuccessfully attempts to counter or dispel your daylight spell-like ability, it must succeed at a Fortitude saving throw (DC 10 + 1/2 your character level + your Charisma modifier) or become blinded for 1 round as its mind is overwhelmed with celestial light. This is a supernatural mind-affecting effect.",
